    "body": "Problem:\r\nFor an optional argument, vim.validate's error message lists only the required type(s), so it wrongly implies nil is not accepted.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nAppend \"|nil\" to the expected types when the argument is optional.\r\n\r\ncloses #40037 \r\n",
